{
  "id": "the-simpsons---5x04---rosebud",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 5x04 - Rosebud",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 5x04 - Rosebud.en.sub",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-13T03:32:08.113Z",
  "lineCount": 271,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "[ Chorus ] \" The Simpsons \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 2240,
      "endMs": 5490
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "[ Tires Screeching ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 5430,
      "endMs": 6800
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "D'oh! [ Screams ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 8410,
      "endMs": 10950
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "\"All we own, we owe \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 39310,
      "endMs": 41300
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "\"All we own, we owe \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 42940,
      "endMs": 45980
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Shh! [ Quietly ] \"All we own, we owe \" \"All we own, we owe \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 46690,
      "endMs": 55030
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "[ Shuddering, Groaning ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 58110,
      "endMs": 60900
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "\"Tra la la la la la Tra la la la la \" I am the happiest boy there is. Aren't I, Bobo? Mmm!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 61470,
      "endMs": 67570
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Happy! Come here, Happy! Yes, Mumsy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 70650,
      "endMs": 73690
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Happy, would you like to continue living with us, your loving, natural parents... or would you rather live with this twisted, loveless billionaire?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 74190,
      "endMs": 82940
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Let's roll.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 85210,
      "endMs": 86730
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Wait! You forgot your bear-- a symbol of your lost youth and innocence!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 88480,
      "endMs": 91920
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "[ Sighs ] Oh, well. At least we still have his little brother, George.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 92950,
      "endMs": 96460
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "\" Ba ba ba bum Oh, the sun shines bright on my old Kentucky home \" \" Ba ba ba bum \" Trust me. It'll be funny when I'm an old man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 97160,
      "endMs": 104070
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "[ Muttering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 110830,
      "endMs": 112830
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "I want my teddy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 113460,
      "endMs": 115820
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Ah, Bobo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 120430,
      "endMs": 121980
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Bobo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 122430,
      "endMs": 124170
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Ah! Oh, it's you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 124830,
      "endMs": 126840
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "The bedpan's under my pillow. Who's... Bobo, sir?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 127480,
      "endMs": 130830
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Bobo? [ Stammering ] I, uh, meant Lobo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 131480,
      "endMs": 134990
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Uh, Sheriff Lobo. They never should have canceled that show.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 135480,
      "endMs": 137990
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "I see. On another topic, the preparations for your birthday have begun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 138390,
      "endMs": 141850
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "I won't get what I really want. No one does.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 142310,
      "endMs": 144320
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "\" [ Singing ] Mmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 146290,
      "endMs": 153080
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Lobo. Lobo. Bring back Sheriff Lobo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 154240,
      "endMs": 157870
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "Lobo! Lobo! [ Screams ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 158390,
      "endMs": 160150
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "What, Homie? Oh, no! Burns's birthday!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 161100,
      "endMs": 164640
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "What's wrong? Every time Mr. Burns has a birthday... all his employees have to help out at the party... and I always get some terrible job.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 165110,
      "endMs": 173800
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Where is that dreaded pinata?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 175280,
      "endMs": 176920
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Ow! Ow! Ow! Missed me. Heh-heh! Ow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 177410,
      "endMs": 180160
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Hmm!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 182110,
      "endMs": 183480
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "[ Laughter ] [ Grunting ] Not funny. And the one in my pants really hurts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184390,
      "endMs": 191550
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "That man who's getting all those laughs, Smithers-- Who is he?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 194660,
      "endMs": 197260
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Homer Simpson, sir, one of the carbon blobs from Sector 7G.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 197560,
      "endMs": 200080
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "But I don't think that-- - I want this Simpson fellow to perform comedy at my party.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 200390,
      "endMs": 204680
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "I must harness his fractured take on modern life.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 204970,
      "endMs": 208120
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Fine, sir. I'll get him started on some snappy Sinbad-esque material.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 208540,
      "endMs": 211900
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "[ Laughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 212560,
      "endMs": 214290
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "I'm so funny. This is gonna be great. What are you doing?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 215720,
      "endMs": 218540
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "I'm writing a delicious send-up of Mr. Burns for his birthday party.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 218950,
      "endMs": 222530
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Is ''poo poo'' one word or two? [ Laughs ] [ Laughs ] I don't think it's a good idea to humiliate your boss on his birthday.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 222980,
      "endMs": 230110
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Actually, Mom, a tweaking of Mr. Burns's foibles, if done with the greatest of care... could earn Dad a special place in the old man's heart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 230470,
      "endMs": 237180
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Well, I also do a delightful impression of him. [ Chuckling ] I paint a frowny face on my butt and pull down my pants!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 237590,
      "endMs": 245320
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "[ Both Laughing ] Yeah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 246140,
      "endMs": 247760
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "[ Both Groaning ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 248300,
      "endMs": 250160
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Now, I'm not saying Mr. Burns is incontinent--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 255620,
      "endMs": 258880
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "[ Laughing] Incontinent! [ Laughing ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 259370,
      "endMs": 261800
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Too rich. - Does either of you know what ''incontinent'' means?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 262000,
      "endMs": 264750
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Lisa, don't spoil our fun. Come on, dear. It's time to go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 265190,
      "endMs": 267680
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Okay, stupid!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 267680,
      "endMs": 269310
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Homer, you've got to stop insulting everyone, especially your boss.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 269730,
      "endMs": 273040
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Marge, the comedy roast is an American tradition.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 273590,
      "endMs": 275790
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "It's what gives us the freedom to criticize our social betters.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 276200,
      "endMs": 279680
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Hey, Flanders! You smell like manure!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 280320,
      "endMs": 283420
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Uh-oh. Better cancel that dinner party tonight. Thanks for the nose news, neighbor!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 283750,
      "endMs": 286890
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "[ Smithers On P.A.] Ladies and gentlemen, I give you ''Montgomery Burns--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 289170,
      "endMs": 292740
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "A Life. '' [ Applause ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 293130,
      "endMs": 295720
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Oh, Bobo. Hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305100,
      "endMs": 307980
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "[ Applause ] - Here are several fine young men who I'm sure are gonna go far.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 309330,
      "endMs": 313320
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, the Ramones. [ Applause ] Ah, these minstrels will soothe my jangled nerves.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 313830,
      "endMs": 319110
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "I'd just like to say this gig sucks! Hey, up yours, Springfield!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 319570,
      "endMs": 323350
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "One, two, three, four!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 323730,
      "endMs": 325740
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "\" Happy birthday to you \" \" Happy birthday \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 329590,
      "endMs": 332060
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "\" Happy birthday to you \" \" Happy birthday \" \" Happy birthday, Burnsie \" \" Happy birthday to you \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 332370,
      "endMs": 339580
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "[ Applause ] Go to hell, you old bastard.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 340360,
      "endMs": 342340
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Hey, I think they liked us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 343150,
      "endMs": 344730
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Have the Rolling Stones killed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 345130,
      "endMs": 346810
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Oh, sir, those aren't-- Do as I say!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 347180,
      "endMs": 349240
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "[ Burns Scoffs ] Stinks. Piffle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 350970,
      "endMs": 353180
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "DustBuster? Yech!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 353570,
      "endMs": 355150
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "[ Groans ] Sir, I've arranged for the people of Australia... to join hands tonight and spell out your name with candles.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 356020,
      "endMs": 362340
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "There's a satellite hookup on that monitor. If you'll just turn your head slightly-- Bah! No time. Next!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 363070,
      "endMs": 368620
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "I have some sad news to report.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 369390,
      "endMs": 371540
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "A small puppy, not unlike Lassie, was just run over in the parking lot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 371930,
      "endMs": 375420
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "[ All Gasp ] - Now it's time for the comedy stylings of Homer Simpson!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 375730,
      "endMs": 379100
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Are you ready to laugh? Oh, that poor dog.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 381390,
      "endMs": 385740
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "I said, ''Are you ready to laugh?''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 386180,
      "endMs": 390180
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Quiet, you awful man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 390620,
      "endMs": 392950
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "You know, Mr. Burns is so cheap-- What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 393350,
      "endMs": 396060
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "I ju-- I mean, you know, Mr. Burns is so old--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 396610,
      "endMs": 400500
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "How dare you! Whoo-hoo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 400830,
      "endMs": 402560
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Tough crowd. Better bring out the big guns. [ Clears Throat ] Here's an impression of Mr. Burns that you might find a little cheeky.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 402930,
      "endMs": 411980
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "[ All Gasp ] I'm Mr. Burns.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 413020,
      "endMs": 415010
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Blah, blah, blah. Do this, do that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 415470,
      "endMs": 418250
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Blah, blah, blah. I think I'm so big. Blah, blah, blah.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 418620,
      "endMs": 423380
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Destroy him. Blah, blah, blah. Look at me-- Ow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 423790,
      "endMs": 426950
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "This party is over.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 427400,
      "endMs": 429160
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "[ Guests Screaming ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 432170,
      "endMs": 434270
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Oww.! Where did I lose 'em?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 434940,
      "endMs": 438780
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "I'll never wiggle my bare butt in public again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 439580,
      "endMs": 442180
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "I'd like to believe that this time. I really would.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 442590,
      "endMs": 445590
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Bart, run down to the store and get a big bag of ice for your father.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 446130,
      "endMs": 449370
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Yes'm. Dad, I know you're discouraged...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 449720,
      "endMs": 451830
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "but, please, don't deny the world your fat can. Don't worry, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 452140,
      "endMs": 454910
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "[ Patting ] She'll be ready for your Aunt Selma's birthday.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 455430,
      "endMs": 458650
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "I knew it. [ Burns Groans ] Look at all the wonderful things you have, Mr. Burns: King Arthur's Excalibur; the only existing nude photo of Mark Twain; and that rare first draft of the Constitution with the word ''suckers'' in it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 459010,
      "endMs": 470040
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Yes, yes, yes. So what? You want your bear, Bobo, don't you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 470390,
      "endMs": 473230
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Liar! I'll give you the thrashing of a lifetime!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 473630,
      "endMs": 476830
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "[ Groaning ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 478420,
      "endMs": 480240
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Resistance is futile.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 480570,
      "endMs": 482080
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "[ Grunts, Sighs ] Oh, God, how I want my bear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 484000,
      "endMs": 486280
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "But he's gone-- gone forever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 486970,
      "endMs": 489100
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "I'd give anything to know what happened to him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 489500,
      "endMs": 492130
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Why, put some grease in your garter, Lindy! You're late!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 505270,
      "endMs": 508090
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "[ Crowd Cheering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 513250,
      "endMs": 514790
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "[ Bomb Whistles, Explodes ] [ Groans ] This is all your fault! [ Grunts ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 516710,
      "endMs": 523670
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "[ Men Grunting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 530000,
      "endMs": 531680
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "You gotta start selling this for more than a dollar a bag.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 535050,
      "endMs": 537340
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "We lost four more men on this expedition.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 537780,
      "endMs": 539590
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "If you can think of a better way to get ice, I'd like to hear it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 540030,
      "endMs": 542570
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Yeah. He's got us there. Beats me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 543610,
      "endMs": 545350
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Hey, Apu, this bag of ice has a head in it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 547510,
      "endMs": 549950
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Ooh, a head bag!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 550350,
      "endMs": 552420
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Those are chock-full of... heady goodness.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 552890,
      "endMs": 556360
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Hey, it's a teddy bear! [ Sniffing ] Ew, gross.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 558380,
      "endMs": 561830
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "It's probably diseased or something. Here, Maggie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 562290,
      "endMs": 565050
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "[ Approaching Footsteps ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 576070,
      "endMs": 577270
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "[ Smithers ] Here's something that should cheer you up, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 578180,
      "endMs": 580420
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "It's me, sir-- Bobo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 581040,
      "endMs": 583140
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Hug me. Squeeze me. Tug at my fur.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 583550,
      "endMs": 585230
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "[ Growls ] Enough! Stop this grotesque charade.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 585620,
      "endMs": 588270
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Now, find my teddy. Oh, and, uh, leave the costume.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 588820,
      "endMs": 593010
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "The Burns bear, perhaps the most valuable ''wittle'' bear in the world, could be anywhere.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 599730,
      "endMs": 604550
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "It could be in your house. You could be looking at it right now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 605010,
      "endMs": 608300
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "It could be right in front of your face as I'm saying this, waggling back and forth...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 608810,
      "endMs": 612270
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "perhaps being held up by a loved one. Maggie, I'm trying to watch TV.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 612740,
      "endMs": 617330
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Put that moldy, old bear down.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 617850,
      "endMs": 619750
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Moldy? Old? I'm gonna get something to eat!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 620610,
      "endMs": 624620
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "[ Growling ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 626750,
      "endMs": 627760
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "\"[ Choir Vocalizing ] Uh! Huh! Uh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 628740,
      "endMs": 633790
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "[ Panicked Yelling, Shouting ] D'oh! Son of a-- You stupid stair! Uh! Ooh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 636680,
      "endMs": 642530
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "[ Gasps ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 643660,
      "endMs": 644620
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "How long have we had these fish?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 646440,
      "endMs": 648410
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Wait. The bear-- Burns's bear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 649210,
      "endMs": 652770
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "''Bobo.'' It's Mr. Burns's bear all right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 653850,
      "endMs": 656840
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Well, Burns isn't getting this back cheap. I can tell you that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 657310,
      "endMs": 659890
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "I think we should just give him the bear that he cherishes so much.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 660310,
      "endMs": 663470
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "[ Both Laughing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 664020,
      "endMs": 666430
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Hmm. Better sew that eye back on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 667900,
      "endMs": 670430
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "No! Let's send Burns the eye in the mail.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 671000,
      "endMs": 673240
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "He'll pay more money if he thinks the bear's in danger. - Yes, we'll send the eye.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 673600,
      "endMs": 677480
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "I'm sure he'll offer us a fair reward, and then we'll make him double it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 677850,
      "endMs": 682430
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Huh? Hmm?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 682850,
      "endMs": 684500
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Well, why can't I be greedy once in a while?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 684880,
      "endMs": 686640
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Bobo. My beautiful Bobo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 687890,
      "endMs": 691060
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "I promise I'll never leave you behind again. [ Clears Throat ] Ah, yes. Naturally, I can't pay you much of a reward, because I'm strapped for cash.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 691620,
      "endMs": 700900
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "[ Creaking ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 701350,
      "endMs": 704240
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Ooh! Uh! As you can see, this old place is falling apart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 704960,
      "endMs": 709450
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "But I'm sure we can come to an understanding. Yes, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 709820,
      "endMs": 712800
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "[ Thinking ] Reject the first offer. Reject the first offer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 713640,
      "endMs": 715620
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "May I offer you a drink? Sorry, Burns. No deal! [ Grunts ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 715990,
      "endMs": 720160
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Ah, don't worry, Smithers. He's playing hardball now... but it won't take him long to crack.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 722210,
      "endMs": 727140
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "[ Cracking Sound ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 729350,
      "endMs": 730630
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Whoo-hoo! I gotta call Burns! I gotta call Burns!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 731120,
      "endMs": 733400
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Maybe I can still get that drink.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 733730,
      "endMs": 735010
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Dad, the longer he has to wait, the more he'll pay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 735460,
      "endMs": 737890
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Right. That makes sense.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 738290,
      "endMs": 739710
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "[ Yelps ] No! No! Let me go! [ Family Shouting, Grunting ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 741540,
      "endMs": 745270
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "I knew you'd come crawling back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 747280,
      "endMs": 749810
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "How much do you want? A million dollars and three Hawaiian islands--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 750180,
      "endMs": 753100
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "good ones, not the leper ones. Done! Now give me that bear!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 753600,
      "endMs": 757090
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Whoo-hoo! I'm rich! Rich, I tells ya!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 757510,
      "endMs": 760020
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Here ya go. [ Grunting ] It seems to be stuck.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 760400,
      "endMs": 765070
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Bad baby! Bad Maggie!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 765870,
      "endMs": 768110
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "[ Whimpering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 772590,
      "endMs": 774590
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Give me the bear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 775110,
      "endMs": 777010
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "The bear. The bear!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 777400,
      "endMs": 779180
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "[ Exasperated Sigh ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 779890,
      "endMs": 780990
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Here you go, Maggie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 785930,
      "endMs": 787650
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "The deal's off, Mr. Burns. The bear stays here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 788080,
      "endMs": 791800
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "You've made a mistake, Simpson. [ Growling ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 792230,
      "endMs": 795060
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Aw, big deal. Who needs his money?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 796990,
      "endMs": 799080
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "We're gettin' by okay. [ Crashing ] Son! You gotta help me! I hit three people on the way over here... and I don't have any insurance!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 799590,
      "endMs": 808620
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "So, how's by you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 809760,
      "endMs": 811230
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "[ Clicking ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 813820,
      "endMs": 815290
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Excellent shot, Smithers. I'll be squeezing my Bobo in no time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 816140,
      "endMs": 819970
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Howdy, gents. What can I didilly-do ya for? [ Moaning ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 820530,
      "endMs": 823600
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "[ Thud ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 824730,
      "endMs": 826410
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Remember, Smithers, in and out in 1 8 seconds.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 826740,
      "endMs": 830090
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Uh! Mm!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 833070,
      "endMs": 834340
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "More cocoa, Mr. Burns? Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 837110,
      "endMs": 839160
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "[ Suction Cups Popping ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 842090,
      "endMs": 844470
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "[ Switch Clicks ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 846550,
      "endMs": 847260
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Mmm. Sixty-four slices of American cheese.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 853030,
      "endMs": 856910
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Sixty-four. [ Gobbling ] Sixty-three.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 857500,
      "endMs": 862040
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Two. [ Weak Gobbling ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 862640,
      "endMs": 866290
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "One.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 867930,
      "endMs": 870150
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Have you been up all night eating cheese? I think I'm blind.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 871710,
      "endMs": 876040
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "[ Suction Cups Pop ] [ Burns Grunts ] Wha--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 876570,
      "endMs": 878400
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Good day to you. [ Groans ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 878400,
      "endMs": 880610
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "[ Clears Throat ] Excuse me. We wanted to see the geek... who valued the happiness of his children more than money.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 882140,
      "endMs": 886310
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Right here. Aw, you said his head was the size of a baseball.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 886780,
      "endMs": 889890
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Ohh. My life can't get any worse.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 890310,
      "endMs": 892780
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "[ Smithers On P.A.] Homer Simpson, report for much worse duties. - D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 893200,
      "endMs": 895340
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Ow! Ow! After lunch, can I whip you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 896520,
      "endMs": 899640
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Nope. Aw, no fair.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 900100,
      "endMs": 901900
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "[ Whip Cracks ] Ow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 902820,
      "endMs": 903740
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Hmm. I wonder what makes it turn. Who cares?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 904520,
      "endMs": 906290
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "[ Groans ] I think we need a new hair dryer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 908920,
      "endMs": 911110
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Marge, you must hate me for not taking Mr. Burns's money.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 911440,
      "endMs": 914310
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "I don't hate you. I'm proud of you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 914730,
      "endMs": 917040
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "You came through for your daughter when she needed you the most.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 917610,
      "endMs": 920540
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Oh, thanks, Marge. But it'll take a lot more than that to comfort this tortured soul.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 920920,
      "endMs": 926340
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "[ Giggles ] Hey, boxy. [ Laughing ] -Give me that!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 926830,
      "endMs": 930830
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Two plus two is four. Two plus two is four.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 931950,
      "endMs": 935380
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Two plus two is four. [ Laughs ] I can see why this is so popular. Look at him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 935810,
      "endMs": 941840
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "[ Chuckles ] Two plus two is four. Two--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 942170,
      "endMs": 944170
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Give me my bear, Simpson! [ Shrieks ] It's The Sou-ou-oul Mass Transit System.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 944620,
      "endMs": 952690
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "[ Panting ] Give it to me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 953250,
      "endMs": 955590
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "[ Remote Control Clicks ] [ Chuckles ] El yoy� es grande.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 956060,
      "endMs": 958750
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "[ Grunts ] Ay, chihuahua.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 959820,
      "endMs": 961400
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "As you can see, Simpson, I have taken over all 78 channels... and you won't see any of your favorite shows again until you give in!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 961730,
      "endMs": 968100
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Whoa! That bites. Holy crap!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 968700,
      "endMs": 970880
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] - What's that you say? You can live without television... as long as you have beer?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 971280,
      "endMs": 977090
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "That's right. Wrong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 977950,
      "endMs": 979350
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "All beer trucks heading toward Springfield have been diverted.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 979950,
      "endMs": 982450
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "This town will be as dry as a bone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982820,
      "endMs": 984710
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "And if the rest of you beer-swilling tube jockeys out there... have a problem with this, talk to Homer Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 985030,
      "endMs": 992360
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "[ Sinister Chuckling ] [ Doorbell Rings ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 992770,
      "endMs": 997060
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Homer, give him what he wants! [ Hammer Cocking ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 997790,
      "endMs": 1001520
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Oh, Barney, leave me alone. Whoops!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1001890,
      "endMs": 1003650
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "[ Barney Thuds, Gun Fires, Glass Breaks, Woman Screams ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1004200,
      "endMs": 1006740
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "[ Siren Wailing ] [ Barney ] Uh-oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1007510,
      "endMs": 1009720
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "My old man can't get a beer because his old man won't give a bear to another old man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1010060,
      "endMs": 1014770
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Let's get him! Wait! Why are we gettin' him?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1015120,
      "endMs": 1018340
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Look, fellas. The first snapdragon of the season. Never mind!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1018690,
      "endMs": 1022740
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Let's just get him! Yeah!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1023090,
      "endMs": 1025350
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "[ Mob Shouting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1025850,
      "endMs": 1027690
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Well, well. Look who's come to apologize.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1028890,
      "endMs": 1032690
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Come on! Let's go in there and get the bear! [ All Shouting ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1033140,
      "endMs": 1035950
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "[ Thumping ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1036640,
      "endMs": 1038530
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Hah! I got it. [ Cheering ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1042520,
      "endMs": 1045860
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Ah, geez. Will you look at that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1048920,
      "endMs": 1051080
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "[ Moans Softly ] Hmm?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1052220,
      "endMs": 1053270
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "What have we become? We've given the word ''mob'' a bad name.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1057940,
      "endMs": 1062070
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "[ Cheerful Chattering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1063550,
      "endMs": 1066110
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "[ Man ] Oh, she'll break a lot ofhearts, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1068620,
      "endMs": 1071060
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "Well, what should we do now? Hey, everybody, let's go sing at the hospital.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1072090,
      "endMs": 1076070
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "\" For we've got high hopes \" \"We've got high hopes \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1076490,
      "endMs": 1082760
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "[ Doorbell Rings ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1083560,
      "endMs": 1084870
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Simpson, look what you've reduced me to. [ Snaps Fingers ] Please! Please!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1085270,
      "endMs": 1090580
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "But, Mr. Burns, it's not my bear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1091070,
      "endMs": 1093520
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "It's Maggie's. Eh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1093900,
      "endMs": 1096290
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "So, good sand today, hmm?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1103950,
      "endMs": 1106240
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Heh! Oh, well. I don't usually, eh-- Well,just this once. Eww!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1108100,
      "endMs": 1112810
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "Damn you paparazzo! Uh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1113650,
      "endMs": 1116120
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Well, Maggie, I've given this a lot of thought.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1117560,
      "endMs": 1119820
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "I'm sure we can come to some sort of agreement.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1120310,
      "endMs": 1123070
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "[ Grunting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1123500,
      "endMs": 1126190
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "[ Panting ] Beaten by an infant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1130100,
      "endMs": 1131730
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "What could be more humiliating?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1132350,
      "endMs": 1133850
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "What a scoop! Okay, Maggie. You win.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1134790,
      "endMs": 1137960
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "But I want you to do something for me. Hang on to that bear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1138840,
      "endMs": 1141430
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "Don't make the same mistake I made. [ Sighs ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1141810,
      "endMs": 1145660
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "[ Sucking Sounds ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1150430,
      "endMs": 1151670
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "For me? Bobo?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1153850,
      "endMs": 1156680
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Ahh! Smithers, I'm so happy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1157480,
      "endMs": 1159690
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Something amazing has happened. I'm actually happy! Take a note: From now on I'm only going to be good and kind to everyone!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1160330,
      "endMs": 1166860
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "I'm sorry, sir. I don't have a pencil.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1167300,
      "endMs": 1169360
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "Ah, don't worry. I'm sure I'll remember it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1169720,
      "endMs": 1171430
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Well, we didn't get any money, but Mr. Burns got what he wanted.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1173750,
      "endMs": 1177390
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Marge, I'm confused. Is this a happy ending or a sad ending?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1178760,
      "endMs": 1182250
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "It's an ending. That's enough.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1182620,
      "endMs": 1184450
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "And there you go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1187080,
      "endMs": 1188710
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "Ah, Bobo. Reunited at last.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1189220,
      "endMs": 1191610
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "But I can't help but wonder what the future holds for you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1192110,
      "endMs": 1194470
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "[ Yawning ] Ah, yes. Wonder.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1195520,
      "endMs": 1198540
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "[ Homers Grunting ] D'oh! D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1203960,
      "endMs": 1206660
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "[ Yelps ] [ Sighs ] Bobo, I know I say this every century, but I'll never leave you behind again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1207460,
      "endMs": 1214620
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Wait for me, sir. Woof!.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1218000,
      "endMs": 1220560
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 5,
    "episode": 4
  }
}
